| `tests/integration/test_regex_fullmatch_gate.py` | Fails a `match` call on a literal regex that ends in `$`, made directly or through a module-level compiled pattern, in `scripts/`, `src/`, `agents/` and `models/`, at its file and line, so a whole-value check uses `fullmatch` and a value with a trailing newline cannot pass it. | `make test` | — | A pattern built at run time or bound in another module is outside this syntactic gate; `search` and `finditer` scans are not judged. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
